# Part 5 — PathName Analysis

Original PathName:

```text
C:\WINDOWS\system32\svchost.exe -k LocalServiceNetworkRestricted -p
```

### My Answer

Executable:

```text
C:\WINDOWS\system32\svchost.exe
```

Arguments:

```text
-k LocalServiceNetworkRestricted -p
```

### Correction

**Correct.**

PathName dapat terdiri dari:

```text
Executable
+
Arguments
```

